<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll take all your wine!</font>

34
00:01:50,590 --> 00:01:51,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You want all of it, right?</font>

35
00:01:51,950 --> 00:01:53,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I'll open them.</font>

36
00:02:45,380 --> 00:02:48,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Turn the clock back one second♪</font>

37
00:02:48,300 --> 00:02:51,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪While the breeze is soft and the sky is young♪</font>

38
00:02:52,300 --> 00:02:55,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's chase every signal from the stars♪</font>

39
00:02:55,100 --> 00:02:58,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪And see where they might land♪</font>

40
00:02:58,860 --> 00:03:01,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Following the path we share♪</font>

41
00:03:01,780 --> 00:03:05,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We trade a knowing glance♪</font>

42
00:03:05,220 --> 00:03:08,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We hold our breath amid the noise♪</font>

43
00:03:08,100 --> 00:03:13,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪For this moment, the world stands still♪</font>

44
00:03:15,380 --> 00:03:19,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The romance left when the tide recedes♪</font>

45
00:03:19,060 --> 00:03:21,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Our story needn't reach the end♪</font>

46
00:03:21,740 --> 00:03:25,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Cast every regret into the clouds♪</font>

47
00:03:25,100 --> 00:03:31,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Just to hold on to this brilliance♪</font>

48
00:03:41,500 --> 00:03:45,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The shimmering waves light the horizon♪</font>

49
00:03:45,100 --> 00:03:47,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Like fireworks in broad daylight♪</font>

50
00:03:47,710 --> 00:03:48,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hexu.</font>

51
00:03:48,180 --> 00:03:50,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Since time never waits for anyone♪</font>

52
00:03:50,680 --> 00:03:51,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where are you guys going?</font>

53
00:03:59,140 --> 00:04:01,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Along the River During the Qingming Festival]</font>

54
00:04:01,140 --> 00:04:03,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Passed Down for Generations]</font>

55
00:04:07,800 --> 00:04:09,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This coffin must've cost a fortune.</font>

56
00:04:11,280 --> 00:04:12,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want to try it.</font>

57
00:04:16,270 --> 00:04:18,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's even made to look like rosewood.</font>

58
00:04:20,920 --> 00:04:23,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haven't seen a coffin this nice in ages.</font>

59
00:04:24,560 --> 00:04:25,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It even smells good.</font>

60
00:04:34,270 --> 00:04:34,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong?</font>

61
00:04:35,800 --> 00:04:36,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who's that?</font>

62
00:04:36,950 --> 00:04:37,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry!</font>

63
00:04:37,800 --> 00:04:38,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on!</font>

64
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:39,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come here.</font>

65
00:04:40,390 --> 00:04:40,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You...</font>

66
00:04:41,160 --> 00:04:41,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at this coffin.</font>

67
00:04:43,160 --> 00:04:43,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's beautiful.</font>

68
00:04:43,870 --> 00:04:45,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You three came rushing over here</font>

69
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:46,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just to see a coffin?</font>

70
00:04:48,920 --> 00:04:50,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's so special about it?</font>

71
00:04:50,920 --> 00:04:51,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Limited edition?</font>

72
00:04:52,390 --> 00:04:53,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A coffin this nice</font>

73
00:04:53,430 --> 00:04:54,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can't just be limited edition.</font>

74
00:04:54,870 --> 00:04:56,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's got to be a secret edition.</font>

75
00:05:00,900 --> 00:05:05,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Along the River During the Qingming Festival, Passed Down for Generations]</font>

76
00:05:05,920 --> 00:05:08,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you guys still standing around?</font>

77
00:05:09,680 --> 00:05:10,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go get changed.</font>

78
00:05:10,800 --> 00:05:12,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're holding a celebration of life for an elder today.</font>

79
00:05:12,510 --> 00:05:13,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The family booked the full mortuary service.</font>

80
00:05:13,630 --> 00:05:14,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone, please cooperate.</font>

81
00:05:14,950 --> 00:05:15,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go!</font>

82
00:05:20,070 --> 00:05:20,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

83
00:05:22,510 --> 00:05:23,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't you hear me?</font>

84
00:05:24,430 --> 00:05:25,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I heard you.</font>

85
00:05:26,160 --> 00:05:27,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can I go with them too?</font>

86
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:30,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your job today is to assist Team Leader Cao</font>

87
00:05:30,430 --> 00:05:31,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and take good care of the family.</font>

88
00:05:32,750 --> 00:05:33,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Absolutely.</font>

89
00:06:00,680 --> 00:06:02,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is the premium coffin you ordered.</font>

90
00:06:03,040 --> 00:06:05,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After preparation, we'll place the deceased inside.</font>

91
00:06:07,190 --> 00:06:09,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don mourning attire. Present the memorial.</font>

92
00:06:09,920 --> 00:06:10,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Receive the spirit.</font>

93
00:06:11,720 --> 00:06:12,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Kneel.</font>

94
00:06:17,510 --> 00:06:19,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mourners and close family may remain.</font>

95
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:22,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone else, please step away for good fortune.</font>

96
00:06:22,250 --> 00:06:23,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Body Transfer Area]</font>

97
00:06:23,870 --> 00:06:27,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take the farewell wine to ward off misfortune.</font>

98
00:06:28,480 --> 00:06:30,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on. Farewell wine.</font>

99
00:06:31,750 --> 00:06:33,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here, take the farewell wine.</font>

100
00:06:33,310 --> 00:06:33,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here.</font>

101
00:06:36,240 --> 00:06:37,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take the farewell wine.</font>

102
00:06:37,070 --> 00:06:39,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Zhou, we're supposed to keep funerals scientific.</font>

103
00:06:39,160 --> 00:06:40,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's skip all this.</font>

104
00:06:40,680 --> 00:06:41,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I understand.</font>

105
00:06:42,360 --> 00:06:44,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But the family specifically asked for it this time.</font>

106
00:06:44,600 --> 00:06:45,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really.</font>

107
00:06:45,630 --> 00:06:46,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just go along with it.</font>

108
00:06:48,510 --> 00:06:49,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Farewell wine. Farewell wine.</font>

109
00:06:49,680 --> 00:06:50,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here.</font>

110
00:06:51,630 --> 00:06:52,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take the farewell wine.</font>

111
00:06:52,480 --> 00:06:53,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just take a little sip.</font>

112
00:06:53,270 --> 00:06:55,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It'll ward off misfortune.</font>

113
00:07:05,190 --> 00:07:07,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The deceased, Zhou Zelong,</font>

114
00:07:08,040 --> 00:07:12,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">passed on the Geng-Shen day of the Jia-Shen month, Yi-Si year,</font>

115
00:07:12,750 --> 00:07:14,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">at the age of 88.</font>

116
00:07:14,950 --> 00:07:16,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His earthly breath now fades away,</font>

117
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:18,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as he rides the blessed crane westward.</font>

118
00:07:19,120 --> 00:07:21,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here stand his family, his devoted children and grandchildren,</font>

119
00:07:22,310 --> 00:07:25,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to bid him farewell. Sound the horn.</font>

120
00:07:26,480 --> 00:07:27,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dad...</font>

121
00:07:31,480 --> 00:07:33,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For everything you've done for me,</font>

122
00:07:33,630 --> 00:07:35,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll repay you in my next life.</font>

123
00:07:37,270 --> 00:07:40,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Rest in peace, Dad.</font>

124
00:07:43,390 --> 00:07:44,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In our line of work,</font>

125
00:07:45,190 --> 00:07:46,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we have to care for the deceased,</font>

126
00:07:47,160 --> 00:07:48,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but we also have to protect ourselves.</font>

127
00:07:49,160 --> 00:07:52,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can't get too emotionally involved.</font>

128
00:07:53,310 --> 00:07:55,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We deal with so many</font>

129
00:07:55,630 --> 00:07:56,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">different people who've passed away every day.</font>

130
00:07:57,680 --> 00:07:58,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'll understand someday.</font>

131
00:08:19,070 --> 00:08:19,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why couldn't you guys</font>

132
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:21,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">get some of that old man's good fortune</font>

133
00:08:22,240 --> 00:08:23,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and live a little longer?</font>

134
00:08:32,700 --> 00:08:36,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Body Transfer Area]</font>

135
00:09:24,150 --> 00:09:25,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you crazy?</font>

136
00:09:25,030 --> 00:09:25,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

137
00:09:28,360 --> 00:09:29,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dumping bodies.</font>

138
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:40,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well, who knew?</font>

139
00:09:41,270 --> 00:09:42,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A serial killer.</font>

140
00:09:44,030 --> 00:09:45,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Anyone left alive in your family?</font>

141
00:09:45,750 --> 00:09:46,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You wiped them all out?</font>

142
00:09:59,030 --> 00:09:59,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hexu.</font>

143
00:09:59,790 --> 00:10:00,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is Dandan around?</font>

144
00:10:00,960 --> 00:10:01,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

145
00:10:02,720 --> 00:10:03,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Any new arrivals coming in?</font>

146
00:10:05,550 --> 00:10:06,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not for now.</font>

147
00:10:06,670 --> 00:10:07,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Great.</font>

148
00:10:07,150 --> 00:10:08,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go help Mortuary Care Department.</font>

149
00:10:09,150 --> 00:10:10,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhou Zelong, the man we received this morning,</font>

150
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:12,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">his family decided to have Mortuary Care Department</font>

151
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:13,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">bathe and dress him.</font>

152
00:10:14,240 --> 00:10:14,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then...</font>

153
00:10:14,720 --> 00:10:15,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What am I supposed to do?</font>

154
00:10:16,080 --> 00:10:17,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After they undressed him,</font>

155
00:10:17,390 --> 00:10:18,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they found a problem.</font>

156
00:10:18,150 --> 00:10:19,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They can't handle it, so they need our help.</font>

157
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:21,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're coworkers. We help each other out.</font>

158
00:10:22,240 --> 00:10:22,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But Team Leader,</font>

159
00:10:22,750 --> 00:10:23,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">last time I helped Mortuary Care Department,</font>

160
00:10:23,750 --> 00:10:25,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan got mad when she found out.</font>

161
00:10:25,480 --> 00:10:26,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do I say if she catches me again?</font>

162
00:10:26,320 --> 00:10:26,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry.</font>

163
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:28,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She definitely won't find out this time.</font>

164
00:10:28,840 --> 00:10:30,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go. They're swamped over there.</font>

165
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:32,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry! Go, go!</font>

166
00:10:33,150 --> 00:10:35,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go! They need help right now.</font>

167
00:10:39,480 --> 00:10:39,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry!</font>

168
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:46,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can.</font>

169
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:47,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop sweeping.</font>

170
00:10:47,910 --> 00:10:49,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go with Hexu and learn from him.</font>

171
00:10:49,670 --> 00:10:50,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I'm not done yet.</font>

172
00:10:50,320 --> 00:10:51,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go! Hurry!</font>

173
00:10:51,320 --> 00:10:52,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Leave it. I'll finish it for you.</font>

174
00:10:52,720 --> 00:10:53,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

175
00:10:54,670 --> 00:10:55,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

176
00:10:55,670 --> 00:10:56,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where are we going?</font>

177
00:10:56,320 --> 00:10:56,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mortuary Care Department.</font>

178
00:10:57,270 --> 00:10:57,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

179
00:10:58,820 --> 00:11:00,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Refrigeration Room, Spa Room, Grace Hall, Peace Hall]</font>

180
00:11:00,080 --> 00:11:00,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This way.</font>

181
00:11:01,620 --> 00:11:03,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Mortuary Care Department]</font>

182
00:11:03,750 --> 00:11:04,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The sunlight's beautiful.</font>

183
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:05,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

184
00:11:05,910 --> 00:11:07,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We chose</font>

185
00:11:07,750 --> 00:11:09,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a south-facing workspace</font>

186
00:11:10,870 --> 00:11:12,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so the families</font>

187
00:11:12,630 --> 00:11:13,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can feel a little warmth</font>

188
00:11:13,870 --> 00:11:14,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as they say goodbye.</font>

189
00:11:20,510 --> 00:11:21,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For this gentleman,</font>

190
00:11:21,790 --> 00:11:23,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">his family chose</font>

191
00:11:23,200 --> 00:11:24,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Fortune, Longevity]
Premium Bathing Service.</font>

192
00:11:24,750 --> 00:11:27,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It includes shampooing, bathing, massage, and makeup.</font>

193
00:11:28,390 --> 00:11:30,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We didn't notice until</font>

194
00:11:30,390 --> 00:11:30,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we undressed him,</font>

195
00:11:31,550 --> 00:11:33,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that he had severe bedsores.</font>

196
00:11:34,510 --> 00:11:36,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We really didn't know how to handle them,</font>

197
00:11:36,630 --> 00:11:38,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so we asked you to help.</font>

198
00:11:45,440 --> 00:11:46,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When will the family view the bathing?</font>

199
00:11:46,750 --> 00:11:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In half an hour.</font>

200
00:11:47,790 --> 00:11:49,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're already in the waiting area.</font>

201
00:11:50,670 --> 00:11:51,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me take a look.</font>

202
00:11:51,240 --> 00:11:51,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

203
00:12:20,320 --> 00:12:22,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">First, cover the bedsore on the back of his shoulder.</font>

204
00:12:23,360 --> 00:12:24,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise, it'll stain his collar.</font>

205
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:25,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

206
00:12:25,360 --> 00:12:27,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's also severe seepage around his waist and abdomen.</font>

207
00:12:27,360 --> 00:12:28,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll need to clean and dry those areas.</font>

208
00:12:28,960 --> 00:12:30,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You haven't plugged the anus either, right?</font>

209
00:12:30,630 --> 00:12:32,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise, fluid could leak out</font>

210
00:12:32,550 --> 00:12:33,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and stain his burial pants.</font>

211
00:12:34,030 --> 00:12:36,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The bedsores around the anus are the worst.</font>

212
00:12:36,790 --> 00:12:38,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We really don't know how to treat them.</font>

213
00:12:39,510 --> 00:12:40,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll handle it.</font>

214
00:12:40,790 --> 00:12:42,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks, you two.</font>

215
00:12:42,030 --> 00:12:43,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go reassure the family.</font>

216
00:12:50,150 --> 00:12:51,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Help me turn him over.</font>

217
00:12:51,660 --> 00:12:59,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[In Memoriam]</font>

218
00:13:00,720 --> 00:13:01,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are the bedsores bad?</font>

219
00:13:03,910 --> 00:13:04,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did this happen?</font>

220
00:13:06,120 --> 00:13:07,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He was bedridden for a long time.</font>

221
00:13:07,630 --> 00:13:08,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No matter how attentive the family was,</font>

222
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:09,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they couldn't prevent it.</font>

223
00:13:12,450 --> 00:13:13,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He couldn't look his best</font>

224
00:13:13,910 --> 00:13:15,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">while he was alive.</font>

225
00:13:16,960 --> 00:13:18,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But at least when he leaves,</font>

226
00:13:19,220 --> 00:13:20,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[In Memoriam]</font>

227
00:13:20,080 --> 00:13:21,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we can make sure he looks his best</font>

228
00:13:21,550 --> 00:13:22,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when he says goodbye to his family.</font>

229
00:13:31,740 --> 00:13:37,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Longevity, Longevity]</font>

230
00:13:38,720 --> 00:13:39,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's ready for the family to see.</font>

231
00:13:49,440 --> 00:13:50,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">First part of the Spa Treatment Ceremony,</font>

232
00:13:51,550 --> 00:13:52,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">burn incense and cleanse the body,</font>

233
00:13:53,320 --> 00:13:54,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">honor the deceased.</font>

234
00:13:58,150 --> 00:13:59,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Second part of the Spa Treatment Ceremony,</font>

235
00:13:59,580 --> 00:14:00,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Filial Piety]</font>

236
00:14:00,630 --> 00:14:01,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">wash his hands and face,</font>

237
00:14:02,390 --> 00:14:03,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">dress him with care.</font>

238
00:14:14,840 --> 00:14:16,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Third part of the Spa Treatment Ceremony,</font>

239
00:14:17,360 --> 00:14:18,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the family says goodbye</font>

240
00:14:19,150 --> 00:14:20,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and sees his face one last time.</font>

241
00:14:25,080 --> 00:14:26,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks for helping out today.</font>

242
00:14:27,550 --> 00:14:27,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No problem.</font>

243
00:14:28,510 --> 00:14:30,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've got something else to do, so I'll head out.</font>

244
00:14:30,080 --> 00:14:30,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay. Thanks for your help.</font>

245
00:14:40,300 --> 00:14:42,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Ceremonial Services Department - Flower Room]</font>

246
00:14:51,140 --> 00:14:53,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Ceremonial Services Department - Rehearsal Room]</font>

247
00:14:58,980 --> 00:15:00,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Ceremonial Services Department - Memorial Couplets Room]</font>

248
00:16:02,100 --> 00:16:08,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Awaiting Cremation]</font>

249
00:16:14,700 --> 00:16:19,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Mingde Hall]</font>

250
00:18:03,830 --> 00:18:05,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No wonder you rushed back.</font>

251
00:18:05,350 --> 00:18:06,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Couldn't wait to get to the booze, huh?</font>

252
00:18:07,110 --> 00:18:07,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Me too! Me too!</font>

253
00:18:08,480 --> 00:18:09,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give me some.</font>

254
00:18:09,590 --> 00:18:09,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here.</font>

255
00:18:10,310 --> 00:18:11,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Pour me some.</font>

256
00:18:11,590 --> 00:18:12,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't hog it.</font>

257
00:18:12,790 --> 00:18:13,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give me a sip too.</font>

258
00:18:17,160 --> 00:18:17,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here.</font>

259
00:18:22,200 --> 00:18:24,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You guys ever notice how gloomy our office is?</font>

260
00:18:24,510 --> 00:18:25,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's about time.</font>

261
00:18:26,310 --> 00:18:26,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Make yourselves presentable.</font>

262
00:18:36,310 --> 00:18:37,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright, let's go.</font>

263
00:18:39,830 --> 00:18:40,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can, come with us.</font>

264
00:18:42,110 --> 00:18:42,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where are we going?</font>

265
00:18:43,440 --> 00:18:43,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A meeting.</font>

266
00:18:47,070 --> 00:18:47,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What meeting?</font>

267
00:18:55,980 --> 00:18:57,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[In Memoriam]</font>

268
00:18:57,590 --> 00:18:58,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can.</font>

269
00:19:04,460 --> 00:19:08,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Body Transfer Passage to Cremation]</font>

270
00:19:11,860 --> 00:19:16,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Body Transfer Passage to Cremation]</font>

271
00:19:28,160 --> 00:19:28,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Handoff complete.</font>

272
00:19:29,270 --> 00:19:30,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Got it.</font>

273
00:19:31,790 --> 00:19:32,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

274
00:19:44,350 --> 00:19:44,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao Erzhe.</font>

275
00:19:45,720 --> 00:19:47,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just discovered something. Want to hear it?</font>

276
00:19:48,240 --> 00:19:48,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You...</font>

277
00:19:49,480 --> 00:19:51,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You didn't peek at my toilet password, did you?</font>

278
00:19:51,310 --> 00:19:52,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're no fun.</font>

279
00:19:52,270 --> 00:19:53,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Always thinking dirty.</font>

280
00:19:53,750 --> 00:19:55,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was upstairs at Mortuary Care Department</font>

281
00:19:55,510 --> 00:19:57,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and saw an unused workspace next door.</font>

282
00:19:57,350 --> 00:19:59,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our whole mortuary prep team could move up there.</font>

283
00:19:59,960 --> 00:20:01,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It gets sunlight,</font>

284
00:20:01,070 --> 00:20:02,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has windows and great ventilation.</font>

285
00:20:02,590 --> 00:20:03,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then when you burn mugwort during embalming,</font>

286
00:20:04,000 --> 00:20:04,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the smell wouldn't be nearly as strong.</font>

287
00:20:07,590 --> 00:20:08,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Useless.</font>

288
00:20:08,350 --> 00:20:08,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianshuang.</font>

289
00:20:09,240 --> 00:20:10,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll bring it up with management later.</font>

290
00:20:10,510 --> 00:20:11,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You think you're on vacation?</font>

291
00:20:11,960 --> 00:20:12,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Keep it down.</font>

292
00:20:12,830 --> 00:20:13,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm serious, Hexu.</font>

293
00:20:13,870 --> 00:20:15,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's really nice next to Mortuary Care Department.</font>

294
00:20:15,720 --> 00:20:16,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then</font>

295
00:20:16,400 --> 00:20:17,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you could do makeup for the deceased there.</font>

296
00:20:17,790 --> 00:20:18,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianshuang.</font>

297
00:20:18,310 --> 00:20:19,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dressing them in burial clothes would be easier too.</font>

298
00:20:20,270 --> 00:20:21,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's an unused space up there,</font>

299
00:20:21,750 --> 00:20:23,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but we've never moved into it.</font>

300
00:20:23,030 --> 00:20:24,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why do you think that is?</font>

301
00:20:24,550 --> 00:20:25,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You think it's waiting for you?</font>

302
00:20:25,590 --> 00:20:26,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course it's waiting for me.</font>

303
00:20:26,510 --> 00:20:27,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Think any of you three will ever get us out of here?</font>

304
00:20:28,030 --> 00:20:29,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm trying to make things better for all of us.</font>

305
00:20:29,480 --> 00:20:30,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why else</font>

306
00:20:30,400 --> 00:20:31,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">do Forensics and Mortuary Care Department</font>

307
00:20:31,790 --> 00:20:32,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">get to work upstairs</font>

308
00:20:32,590 --> 00:20:33,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">while we're stuck underground?</font>

309
00:20:38,880 --> 00:20:39,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tired?</font>

310
00:20:39,310 --> 00:20:40,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Want me to carry that for you?</font>

311
00:20:40,310 --> 00:20:41,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're not senior enough.</font>

312
00:20:42,070 --> 00:20:42,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not senior enough?</font>

313
00:20:43,110 --> 00:20:43,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Neither are you.</font>

314
00:20:44,160 --> 00:20:45,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">None of us on the mortuary prep team are.</font>

315
00:20:45,070 --> 00:20:46,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guess we only deserve to work underground.</font>

316
00:20:47,750 --> 00:20:48,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why?</font>

317
00:20:52,790 --> 00:20:54,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The deceased who come here</font>

318
00:20:54,110 --> 00:20:55,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">probably have more reason to ask "why" than we do.</font>

319
00:20:56,350 --> 00:20:57,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you can't stand it here, you can leave.</font>

320
00:20:58,070 --> 00:20:59,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're used to it.</font>

321
00:21:14,740 --> 00:21:17,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Homeward Tower]</font>

322
00:21:24,920 --> 00:21:25,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not late, am I?</font>

323
00:21:25,880 --> 00:21:26,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, we just got here too.</font>

324
00:21:27,110 --> 00:21:28,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, let's get started.</font>

325
00:21:29,110 --> 00:21:30,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please wait a moment.</font>

326
00:21:30,510 --> 00:21:31,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Waiting for Dr. Li?</font>

327
00:21:31,640 --> 00:21:32,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't bother.</font>

328
00:21:32,200 --> 00:21:33,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's still doing an autopsy.</font>

329
00:21:33,310 --> 00:21:33,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

330
00:21:34,030 --> 00:21:34,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Kids.</font>

331
00:21:36,240 --> 00:21:37,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Business Department</font>

332
00:21:37,750 --> 00:21:39,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">made this from leftover flowers.</font>

333
00:21:39,640 --> 00:21:40,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Fang Jiugang, Logistics Department]
Looks pretty good to me.</font>

334
00:21:40,750 --> 00:21:41,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Mortuary Prep Team Support]
And nothing went to waste.</font>

335
00:21:42,920 --> 00:21:44,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These kids really know how to save.</font>

336
00:21:47,550 --> 00:21:48,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can.</font>

337
00:21:48,510 --> 00:21:49,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Mr. Fang. - You're back.</font>

338
00:21:50,270 --> 00:21:50,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're staying this time, right?</font>

339
00:21:52,680 --> 00:21:53,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm staying.</font>

340
00:21:54,200 --> 00:21:54,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's more like it.</font>

341
00:21:55,680 --> 00:21:56,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now that's more like it.</font>

342
00:21:56,960 --> 00:21:57,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then let's...</font>

343
00:21:57,750 --> 00:21:58,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's get started.</font>

344
00:21:58,440 --> 00:21:59,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, let's go.</font>

345
00:22:03,510 --> 00:22:05,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Body ID 20348273.</font>

346
00:22:06,270 --> 00:22:08,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">On July 20, 2023,</font>

347
00:22:08,110 --> 00:22:10,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it was found in wasteland outside Meizhen Village, Fushan City.</font>

348
00:22:11,310 --> 00:22:13,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Homeward Tower]
Name and identity unknown.</font>

349
00:22:13,590 --> 00:22:15,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Notices were published and the case posted online.</font>

350
00:22:16,270 --> 00:22:17,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The body was kept in cold storage for 12 months.</font>

351
00:22:18,480 --> 00:22:19,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No employer or family came forward.</font>

352
00:22:20,400 --> 00:22:21,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was confirmed as an unidentified body.</font>

353
00:22:22,750 --> 00:22:25,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Forensics took photos, records, and fingerprints,</font>

354
00:22:25,400 --> 00:22:26,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and preserved biological evidence for identification.</font>

355
00:22:27,480 --> 00:22:29,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All information has been entered</font>

356
00:22:29,350 --> 00:22:30,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">into the Forensics Department's Homeward Bound Initiative file.</font>

357
00:22:31,070 --> 00:22:33,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Efforts will continue to identify the deceased</font>

358
00:22:33,400 --> 00:22:34,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and locate any relatives.</font>

359
00:22:35,270 --> 00:22:37,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The ashes have now been stored for 12 months.</font>

360
00:22:37,440 --> 00:22:39,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Under the rules for unidentified remains,</font>

361
00:22:39,790 --> 00:22:41,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">funeral home staff are entrusted</font>

362
00:22:41,240 --> 00:22:42,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with interring the ashes.</font>

363
00:22:43,510 --> 00:22:45,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chen Hexu of the Qingliangshan Mortuary Preparation Team.</font>

364
00:22:45,640 --> 00:22:46,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Song Tianshuang.</font>

365
00:22:46,550 --> 00:22:47,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao Erzhe.</font>

366
00:22:54,070 --> 00:22:54,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can.</font>

367
00:22:56,200 --> 00:22:57,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At the request of the Forensics Department,</font>

368
00:22:57,920 --> 00:22:59,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we received the remains of an unidentified person.</font>

369
00:22:59,750 --> 00:23:01,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We will now hold a memorial</font>

370
00:23:01,350 --> 00:23:02,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and inter the ashes.</font>

371
00:23:03,880 --> 00:23:04,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Make yourselves presentable.</font>

372
00:23:14,380 --> 00:23:16,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[In Memoriam]</font>

373
00:23:28,660 --> 00:23:31,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[In Memoriam]</font>

374
00:23:32,350 --> 00:23:33,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Inter the ashes.</font>

375
00:23:55,310 --> 00:23:56,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The deceased is unidentified.</font>

376
00:23:57,240 --> 00:23:57,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Male.</font>

377
00:23:58,480 --> 00:24:00,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He passed away in the wilderness of Fushan.</font>

378
00:24:02,590 --> 00:24:03,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today,</font>

379
00:24:04,000 --> 00:24:05,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we are here to see him off.</font>

380
00:24:07,000 --> 00:24:07,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">May he</font>

381
00:24:08,160 --> 00:24:09,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">ride the wind home</font>

382
00:24:09,880 --> 00:24:10,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and find peace beyond this world.</font>

383
00:24:13,550 --> 00:24:14,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your journey through life</font>

384
00:24:15,110 --> 00:24:16,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is now complete.</font>

385
00:24:17,200 --> 00:24:17,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">May you</font>

386
00:24:18,270 --> 00:24:19,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">rest in peace.</font>

387
00:24:51,140 --> 00:24:52,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Homeward Tower]</font>

388
00:24:52,310 --> 00:24:53,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">May the departed find his way home.</font>

389
00:24:55,400 --> 00:24:56,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Rest in peace.</font>

390
00:26:13,960 --> 00:26:14,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong?</font>

391
00:26:19,200 --> 00:26:19,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong with him?</font>

392
00:26:20,510 --> 00:26:22,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He went up the mountain to see off an unidentified man.</font>

393
00:26:22,070 --> 00:26:22,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's been like this since he got back.</font>

394
00:26:25,590 --> 00:26:26,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's weighing on you, huh?</font>

395
00:26:27,510 --> 00:26:28,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's okay.</font>

396
00:26:28,350 --> 00:26:29,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've only been here a few days.</font>

397
00:26:29,480 --> 00:26:30,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'll get used to it with time.</font>

398
00:26:32,750 --> 00:26:34,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We even get children who died at just a few years old.</font>

399
00:26:35,200 --> 00:26:36,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Some parents have superstitious beliefs.</font>

400
00:26:36,750 --> 00:26:37,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They won't keep the ashes,</font>

401
00:26:37,960 --> 00:26:39,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or bury them in the family grave.</font>

402
00:26:39,680 --> 00:26:40,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So we have to scatter those ashes too.</font>

403
00:26:45,480 --> 00:26:45,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can.</font>

404
00:26:46,750 --> 00:26:48,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is actually one of our mortuary prep team's</font>

405
00:26:48,680 --> 00:26:49,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">special duties.</font>

406
00:26:49,880 --> 00:26:52,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No one should have to leave this world alone.</font>

407
00:26:52,510 --> 00:26:53,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We go along so someone can be there for them.</font>

408
00:26:53,680 --> 00:26:54,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's a good deed.</font>

409
00:26:55,000 --> 00:26:56,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't let it weigh on you too much.</font>

410
00:26:57,070 --> 00:26:57,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

411
00:26:57,960 --> 00:26:58,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry, sir.</font>

412
00:26:59,960 --> 00:27:01,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I also think what we do</font>

413
00:27:01,160 --> 00:27:02,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is pretty meaningful.</font>

414
00:27:04,310 --> 00:27:05,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's just...</font>

415
00:27:06,030 --> 00:27:07,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Compared to helping Mortuary Care Department this afternoon...</font>

416
00:27:07,480 --> 00:27:08,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What?</font>

417
00:27:09,440 --> 00:27:10,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you mean?</font>

418
00:27:10,590 --> 00:27:12,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You helped Mortuary Care Department?</font>

419
00:27:13,160 --> 00:27:14,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who told you to go?</font>

420
00:27:15,680 --> 00:27:16,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me explain.</font>

421
00:27:16,720 --> 00:27:17,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is there to explain?</font>

422
00:27:17,960 --> 00:27:19,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They put on all those fancy rituals,</font>

423
00:27:19,640 --> 00:27:21,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and you sent my people over to help with their little show?</font>

424
00:27:21,350 --> 00:27:21,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

425
00:27:22,350 --> 00:27:23,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mortuary Care Department can't handle the job...</font>

426
00:27:23,710 --> 00:27:24,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then they shouldn't be doing it.</font>

427
00:27:25,440 --> 00:27:27,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You used my people without even telling me?</font>

428
00:27:27,120 --> 00:27:28,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm almost late for my personal training session.</font>

429
00:27:29,480 --> 00:27:30,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You always run off when it's time to talk business.</font>

430
00:27:30,680 --> 00:27:31,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cao Yongji!</font>

431
00:27:32,030 --> 00:27:32,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm talking to you!</font>

432
00:27:43,750 --> 00:27:44,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan.</font>

433
00:27:44,960 --> 00:27:45,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Mingquan.</font>

434
00:27:46,720 --> 00:27:48,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not keeping you busy over at Forensics?</font>

435
00:27:48,790 --> 00:27:49,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've got time to come sunbathe?</font>

436
00:27:50,400 --> 00:27:51,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I came here just to wait for you.</font>

437
00:27:52,260 --> 00:27:53,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Li Mingquan, Fushan Public Security Bureau]</font>

438
00:27:53,240 --> 00:27:54,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Forensic Examiner, Forensics Center]
Good. I wanted to ask you.</font>

439
00:27:55,440 --> 00:27:55,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That woman from today,</font>

440
00:27:55,960 --> 00:27:57,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the one whose body was severely curled up...</font>

441
00:27:57,920 --> 00:27:58,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What happened to her?</font>

442
00:27:59,590 --> 00:28:01,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why was her body like that?</font>

443
00:28:03,200 --> 00:28:04,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The girl got into an argument with the suspect.</font>

444
00:28:04,790 --> 00:28:05,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She died from injuries</font>

445
00:28:06,270 --> 00:28:07,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and he stuffed her body into a suitcase.</font>

446
00:28:08,830 --> 00:28:09,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's one of the few truly horrific cases</font>

447
00:28:10,000 --> 00:28:11,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've handled in all these years.</font>

448
00:28:13,960 --> 00:28:15,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What was her relationship with the suspect?</font>

449
00:28:16,550 --> 00:28:17,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They were a couple.</font>

450
00:28:21,720 --> 00:28:22,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You came all this way just to tell me?</font>

451
00:28:23,350 --> 00:28:24,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I didn't,</font>

452
00:28:24,440 --> 00:28:25,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">knowing you,</font>

453
00:28:25,880 --> 00:28:26,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'd be thinking about it for ages.</font>

454
00:28:29,270 --> 00:28:30,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No matter what</font>

455
00:28:31,310 --> 00:28:32,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">someone goes through in life,</font>

456
00:28:33,070 --> 00:28:34,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when they finally come to me,</font>

457
00:28:35,350 --> 00:28:36,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">all I can do</font>

458
00:28:36,960 --> 00:28:38,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is do the very best I can</font>

459
00:28:39,960 --> 00:28:41,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to give them a proper farewell</font>

460
00:28:42,160 --> 00:28:43,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and let them leave with dignity.</font>

461
00:28:46,480 --> 00:28:47,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Anything else?</font>

462
00:28:48,030 --> 00:28:48,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

463
00:28:49,240 --> 00:28:50,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then why aren't you off work yet?</font>

464
00:28:51,240 --> 00:28:51,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You worked hard today.</font>

465
00:28:52,480 --> 00:28:53,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Want to grab a couple drinks?</font>

466
00:28:54,000 --> 00:28:54,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're buying?</font>

467
00:28:55,240 --> 00:28:56,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When have I ever made you pay for drinks?</font>

468
00:29:10,030 --> 00:29:10,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hexu.</font>

469
00:29:14,680 --> 00:29:15,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This afternoon,</font>

470
00:29:16,750 --> 00:29:18,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when we went to the meeting,</font>

471
00:29:19,160 --> 00:29:20,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I shouldn't have snapped at you.</font>

472
00:29:22,320 --> 00:29:23,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was being unreasonable.</font>

473
00:29:25,270 --> 00:29:26,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Next time, just give me a heads-up.</font>

474
00:29:28,590 --> 00:29:30,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know you meant well.</font>

475
00:29:34,400 --> 00:29:35,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But Mortuary Care Department</font>

476
00:29:36,480 --> 00:29:38,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">doesn't do the same kind of work we do.</font>

477
00:29:40,750 --> 00:29:41,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Their job is to make money.</font>

478
00:29:42,200 --> 00:29:43,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our job is to be the safety net.</font>

479
00:29:44,790 --> 00:29:45,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">On the mortuary prep team,</font>

480
00:29:46,790 --> 00:29:48,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">everyone gets the same treatment when they leave.</font>

481
00:29:49,920 --> 00:29:50,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whether they're</font>

482
00:29:51,200 --> 00:29:52,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a normal case,</font>

483
00:29:53,160 --> 00:29:54,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">an unusual case,</font>

484
00:29:56,200 --> 00:29:58,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or unidentified and unclaimed,</font>

485
00:29:59,270 --> 00:30:00,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">our job</font>

486
00:30:01,000 --> 00:30:02,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is to care for them properly</font>

487
00:30:03,410 --> 00:30:05,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and let them leave with dignity.</font>

488
00:30:06,350 --> 00:30:07,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where we work</font>

489
00:30:08,000 --> 00:30:08,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">doesn't matter at all.</font>

490
00:30:10,110 --> 00:30:10,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What matters</font>

491
00:30:11,680 --> 00:30:12,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is that we do everything we can</font>

492
00:30:13,750 --> 00:30:15,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to make up for the unfairness they faced in life,</font>

493
00:30:17,440 --> 00:30:19,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so everyone is equal in death.</font>

494
00:30:22,350 --> 00:30:23,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's why we're here.</font>

495
00:30:40,340 --> 00:30:44,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Qingliangshan Funeral Home, Employee ID]</font>

496
00:30:56,000 --> 00:30:57,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A bartender.</font>

497
00:30:57,830 --> 00:30:58,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bartender.</font>

498
00:30:59,830 --> 00:31:01,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A bar, a counter.</font>

499
00:31:02,000 --> 00:31:04,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A bar literally means a piece of wood.</font>

500
00:31:04,750 --> 00:31:07,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That wood separates the guests from the bartender.</font>

501
00:31:08,400 --> 00:31:08,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And "tender"</font>

502
00:31:09,880 --> 00:31:11,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">also means gentle.</font>

503
00:31:11,680 --> 00:31:14,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Treating every guest with care.</font>

504
00:31:15,310 --> 00:31:18,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't an embalmer's job kind of the same?</font>

505
00:31:19,960 --> 00:31:21,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You serve your clients</font>

506
00:31:22,350 --> 00:31:23,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with a coffin between you.</font>

507
00:31:25,110 --> 00:31:29,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're both separated by a piece of wood.</font>

508
00:31:29,660 --> 00:31:30,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Homeward Tower, In Memoriam]</font>

509
00:31:30,680 --> 00:31:31,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You</font>

510
00:31:32,070 --> 00:31:33,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">guide people across life and death.</font>

511
00:31:34,110 --> 00:31:36,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We guide them through their desires.</font>

512
00:31:49,500 --> 00:31:52,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Zheng Lingli, Business Department, Wang Can's Mom]</font>

513
00:31:52,880 --> 00:31:54,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're going back to the mortuary prep team?</font>

514
00:31:57,400 --> 00:31:58,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've been back for two days.</font>

515
00:31:58,680 --> 00:31:59,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was afraid to tell you.</font>

516
00:32:00,110 --> 00:32:01,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Say that again!</font>

517
00:32:01,750 --> 00:32:02,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Where are you going back to? - Honey.</font>

518
00:32:02,560 --> 00:32:02,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Calm down.</font>

519
00:32:02,960 --> 00:32:03,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Calm down.</font>

520
00:32:04,440 --> 00:32:05,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Calm down. Please.</font>

521
00:32:06,110 --> 00:32:07,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- This is all your fault! - I...</font>

522
00:32:10,400 --> 00:32:12,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You got a little money and thought you were rich!</font>

523
00:32:12,960 --> 00:32:15,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When our land was bought out, we got some cash,</font>

524
00:32:15,360 --> 00:32:16,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and you started throwing money around!</font>

525
00:32:16,920 --> 00:32:18,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A little sports car in one hand,</font>

526
00:32:18,790 --> 00:32:20,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a fancy house in the country in the other!</font>

527
00:32:20,920 --> 00:32:22,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And what do we have left now?</font>

528
00:32:23,030 --> 00:32:24,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nothing but</font>

529
00:32:24,830 --> 00:32:26,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">all this flashy junk.</font>

530
00:32:27,380 --> 00:32:29,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And we still had to come back to Qingliangshan.</font>

531
00:32:29,270 --> 00:32:29,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You!</font>

532
00:32:31,200 --> 00:32:31,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Back then,</font>

533
00:32:32,350 --> 00:32:34,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when you graduated, you had every right</font>

534
00:32:34,590 --> 00:32:36,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to work at Qingliangshan.</font>

535
00:32:36,310 --> 00:32:37,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But you refused.</font>

536
00:32:37,640 --> 00:32:40,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You listened to your dad and went to Beijing to make it big.</font>

537
00:32:40,440 --> 00:32:41,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You even wanted to open</font>

538
00:32:41,750 --> 00:32:42,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">some bar.</font>

539
00:32:42,880 --> 00:32:43,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How'd that work out?</font>

540
00:32:43,720 --> 00:32:44,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It went under ages ago, didn't it?</font>

541
00:32:46,000 --> 00:32:48,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now you're sneaking back</font>

542
00:32:48,440 --> 00:32:49,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to Qingliangshan again.</font>

543
00:32:50,590 --> 00:32:52,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What, are you going in circles with your life?</font>

544
00:32:53,240 --> 00:32:53,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly.</font>

545
00:32:54,240 --> 00:32:56,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We worked so hard to send you to Beijing.</font>

546
00:32:56,480 --> 00:32:57,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why come back?</font>

547
00:32:59,270 --> 00:33:00,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Things didn't go your way out there?</font>

548
00:33:01,860 --> 00:33:03,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then hang in there a little longer.</font>

549
00:33:03,070 --> 00:33:04,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Try to make a comeback.</font>

550
00:33:06,020 --> 00:33:07,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Life</font>

551
00:33:07,160 --> 00:33:08,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has its highs and lows,</font>

552
00:33:08,740 --> 00:33:09,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">its ups and downs,</font>

553
00:33:09,550 --> 00:33:10,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and plenty of twists and turns.</font>

554
00:33:11,070 --> 00:33:12,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't spend your whole life</font>

555
00:33:12,480 --> 00:33:14,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">underground with the mortuary prep team.</font>

556
00:33:14,990 --> 00:33:17,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't fail twice in one lifetime.</font>

557
00:33:17,400 --> 00:33:19,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And I shouldn't end up with two losers,</font>

558
00:33:19,550 --> 00:33:20,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but here we are!</font>

559
00:33:22,590 --> 00:33:23,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have to go back to Qingliangshan.</font>

560
00:33:24,240 --> 00:33:24,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you dare!</font>

561
00:33:25,000 --> 00:33:26,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you remember how you left?</font>

562
00:33:26,200 --> 00:33:27,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know what happened.</font>

563
00:33:27,070 --> 00:33:28,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And now you want to go back?</font>

564
00:33:28,290 --> 00:33:29,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Aren't you embarrassed?</font>

565
00:33:32,110 --> 00:33:32,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really have to go back.</font>

566
00:33:34,400 --> 00:33:36,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- I swear, I'm going to smack you!
- Honey!</font>

567
00:33:36,030 --> 00:33:36,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Sa passed away.</font>

568
00:33:36,960 --> 00:33:37,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't!</font>

569
00:33:40,140 --> 00:33:41,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The doctor said</font>

570
00:33:41,550 --> 00:33:42,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">years of overwork and staying up late</font>

571
00:33:43,550 --> 00:33:45,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">caused sudden cardiac death.</font>

572
00:33:46,920 --> 00:33:47,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It happened so suddenly.</font>

573
00:33:49,030 --> 00:33:50,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">None of us were prepared.</font>

574
00:33:50,250 --> 00:33:51,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Forever in Our Hearts]</font>

575
00:33:51,400 --> 00:33:53,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thankfully, the funeral home staff helped us.</font>

576
00:33:54,200 --> 00:33:55,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They even carefully shaved him.</font>

577
00:33:56,880 --> 00:33:58,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They made sure he looked his best when he left.</font>

578
00:33:59,640 --> 00:34:00,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He</font>

579
00:34:01,240 --> 00:34:01,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">always cared most</font>

580
00:34:01,960 --> 00:34:03,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">about his beard.</font>

581
00:34:05,030 --> 00:34:06,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In the end, Li Sa</font>

582
00:34:06,200 --> 00:34:08,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was laid to rest somewhere with a beautiful sunset.</font>

583
00:34:10,320 --> 00:34:11,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The breeze felt so nice that day.</font>

584
00:34:13,550 --> 00:34:15,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It reminded me of the words</font>

585
00:34:15,590 --> 00:34:16,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">carved outside our funeral services department.</font>

586
00:34:18,480 --> 00:34:19,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"All things share one home.</font>

587
00:34:20,550 --> 00:34:21,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Life and death are one."</font>

588
00:34:23,110 --> 00:34:23,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think</font>

589
00:34:25,400 --> 00:34:26,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he would've liked it there.</font>

590
00:34:36,670 --> 00:34:37,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Two, please.</font>

591
00:34:37,360 --> 00:34:37,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here, have a seat.</font>

592
00:34:38,000 --> 00:34:38,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, thanks.</font>

593
00:34:43,970 --> 00:34:44,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can,</font>

594
00:34:44,900 --> 00:34:46,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your drinks aren't that great,</font>

595
00:34:46,360 --> 00:34:48,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but you sure know how to talk.</font>

596
00:34:48,100 --> 00:34:48,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright.</font>

597
00:34:48,710 --> 00:34:49,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you take a job</font>

598
00:34:49,960 --> 00:34:51,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">where there's no one to chat with,</font>

599
00:34:51,840 --> 00:34:52,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">wouldn't the silence drive you crazy?</font>

600
00:34:52,840 --> 00:34:55,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">European craftsmanship, made in Asia.</font>

601
00:34:56,110 --> 00:34:56,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everybody wins.</font>

602
00:34:59,550 --> 00:35:00,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So what counts as heavy?</font>

603
00:35:00,960 --> 00:35:01,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Life and death?</font>

604
00:35:02,000 --> 00:35:02,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then forget bartending.</font>

605
00:35:02,800 --> 00:35:03,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go home</font>

606
00:35:03,320 --> 00:35:04,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and work in the funeral business with my parents.</font>

607
00:35:04,510 --> 00:35:05,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong with that?</font>

608
00:35:06,840 --> 00:35:07,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's meaningless.</font>

609
00:35:08,150 --> 00:35:08,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then</font>

610
00:35:09,840 --> 00:35:10,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what is meaningful?</font>

611
00:35:16,280 --> 00:35:17,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What you're doing right now is pretty pointless.</font>

612
00:35:17,280 --> 00:35:17,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Make me another.</font>

613
00:35:19,110 --> 00:35:19,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Another one.</font>

614
00:35:20,800 --> 00:35:24,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My first successful martini.</font>

615
00:35:24,760 --> 00:35:25,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell me what you think.</font>

616
00:35:38,880 --> 00:35:39,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong?</font>

617
00:35:40,110 --> 00:35:41,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The drink takes after its maker.</font>

618
00:35:43,440 --> 00:35:43,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Photogenic.</font>

619
00:35:44,030 --> 00:35:44,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And very innocent.</font>

620
00:35:57,030 --> 00:35:58,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Uncle Li]
Can, thanks for everything.</font>

621
00:35:59,030 --> 00:36:00,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Sa passed so suddenly.</font>

622
00:36:00,670 --> 00:36:02,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've done so much to help us these past few days.</font>

623
00:36:02,340 --> 00:36:03,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Business for Sale, Good Night]</font>

624
00:36:03,000 --> 00:36:04,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As for wrapping things up at the bar,</font>

625
00:36:05,110 --> 00:36:06,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd really appreciate it if you could take care of that.</font>

626
00:36:09,480 --> 00:36:10,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After Li Sa passed,</font>

627
00:36:10,820 --> 00:36:12,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the regulars stopped coming too.</font>

628
00:36:12,330 --> 00:36:13,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Good Night]</font>

629
00:36:13,330 --> 00:36:14,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So I sold the bar.</font>

630
00:36:15,920 --> 00:36:17,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I gave the money to his parents.</font>

631
00:36:20,510 --> 00:36:21,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your son didn't make the wrong choice, did he?</font>

632
00:36:43,140 --> 00:36:44,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Employee ID]</font>

633
00:36:51,710 --> 00:36:52,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Morning!</font>

634
00:36:56,400 --> 00:36:56,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where's Wang Can?</font>

635
00:36:57,760 --> 00:36:58,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haven't seen him.</font>

636
00:36:59,920 --> 00:37:00,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

637
00:37:00,800 --> 00:37:02,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's already showing up late?</font>

638
00:37:03,840 --> 00:37:05,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He didn't even take his badge.</font>

639
00:37:05,590 --> 00:37:06,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Think he quit?</font>

640
00:37:08,360 --> 00:37:09,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No way.</font>

641
00:37:18,670 --> 00:37:19,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two were the last ones here after work yesterday.</font>

642
00:37:19,880 --> 00:37:20,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you say something to him?</font>

643
00:37:22,710 --> 00:37:23,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just had a heart-to-heart with him.</font>

644
00:37:24,960 --> 00:37:25,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What did you tell him?</font>

645
00:37:28,440 --> 00:37:29,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just...</font>

646
00:37:29,800 --> 00:37:30,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Told him the facts.</font>

647
00:37:31,280 --> 00:37:32,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">W-What facts did you tell him?</font>

648
00:37:33,320 --> 00:37:34,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I told him about the nature of our work</font>

649
00:37:34,800 --> 00:37:35,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">on the mortuary prep team.</font>

650
00:37:36,000 --> 00:37:36,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's only been here a few days!</font>

651
00:37:36,840 --> 00:37:38,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why would you tell him all that?</font>

652
00:37:39,440 --> 00:37:40,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're always saying we're short-staffed!</font>

653
00:37:40,840 --> 00:37:42,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then someone shows up, and this is how you treat him?</font>

654
00:37:43,230 --> 00:37:44,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you arguing this early?</font>

655
00:37:44,880 --> 00:37:45,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan.</font>

656
00:37:45,630 --> 00:37:47,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hexu scared Wang Can off.</font>

657
00:37:47,760 --> 00:37:48,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He left?</font>

658
00:37:49,590 --> 00:37:50,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

659
00:37:50,510 --> 00:37:52,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He just said hi to me at the door.</font>

660
00:37:55,760 --> 00:37:57,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Son, I'm here!</font>

661
00:37:58,000 --> 00:37:58,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dad.</font>

662
00:37:59,670 --> 00:38:00,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry, hurry, hurry!</font>

663
00:38:09,400 --> 00:38:10,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His dad came to pick him up again.</font>

664
00:38:14,060 --> 00:38:16,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Wang Can]</font>

665
00:38:22,400 --> 00:38:23,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I knew it.</font>

666
00:38:23,790 --> 00:38:25,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look, your coworkers are waiting for you.</font>

667
00:38:26,150 --> 00:38:27,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't go! Don't go!</font>

668
00:38:27,760 --> 00:38:28,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why'd you all come out?</font>

669
00:38:29,550 --> 00:38:31,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm totally ready to join</font>

670
00:38:31,110 --> 00:38:31,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">our mortuary prep team.</font>

671
00:38:32,150 --> 00:38:32,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look.</font>

672
00:38:38,630 --> 00:38:38,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well?</font>

673
00:38:39,670 --> 00:38:41,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Starting today, I'll work with you guys</font>

674
00:38:41,360 --> 00:38:42,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to make sure the deceased are cared for.</font>

675
00:38:49,360 --> 00:38:51,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll send them off to the next world with dignity.</font>

676
00:39:03,710 --> 00:39:05,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See? I told you Can wouldn't leave.</font>

677
00:39:07,280 --> 00:39:08,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing, Mao Erzhe?</font>

678
00:39:09,480 --> 00:39:10,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you filming me?</font>

679
00:39:11,330 --> 00:39:12,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll get you!</font>

680
00:39:12,920 --> 00:39:14,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao, send it to the group chat.</font>

681
00:39:14,410 --> 00:39:15,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Team Leader.</font>

682
00:39:29,380 --> 00:39:36,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Good Night Signature Cocktail - Good Night]</font>

683
00:39:36,440 --> 00:39:37,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't hold it anymore.</font>

684
00:39:37,130 --> 00:39:38,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Beijing, Four Years Ago]</font>

685
00:39:38,180 --> 00:39:38,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hold it! Hold it!</font>

686
00:39:38,920 --> 00:39:39,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't!</font>

687
00:39:39,440 --> 00:39:40,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is Beijing. You can't just...</font>

688
00:39:40,590 --> 00:39:41,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- pee wherever you want!
- I can't hold it!</font>

689
00:39:41,670 --> 00:39:42,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here!</font>

690
00:39:42,030 --> 00:39:42,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Good Night]
There's a bar here.</font>

691
00:39:42,840 --> 00:39:43,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go in.</font>

692
00:39:43,760 --> 00:39:44,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, no.</font>

693
00:39:44,320 --> 00:39:45,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm supposed to be some rich kid.</font>

694
00:39:45,360 --> 00:39:46,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't embarrass me!</font>

695
00:39:46,300 --> 00:39:46,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

696
00:39:48,670 --> 00:39:49,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're not using their bathroom for free.</font>

697
00:39:50,320 --> 00:39:51,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get us a bottle of Moutai.</font>

698
00:39:53,110 --> 00:39:54,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're a cocktail bar.</font>

699
00:39:54,840 --> 00:39:55,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cocktails are our specialty.</font>

700
00:39:55,800 --> 00:39:56,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">By the bottle,</font>

701
00:39:56,920 --> 00:39:58,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we only sell champagne</font>

702
00:39:58,840 --> 00:39:59,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and whiskey.</font>

703
00:39:59,760 --> 00:40:00,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Got it.</font>

704
00:40:01,710 --> 00:40:03,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We don't carry Moutai yet.</font>

705
00:40:03,190 --> 00:40:03,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

706
00:40:03,800 --> 00:40:04,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where's the Moutai?</font>

707
00:40:04,480 --> 00:40:05,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My dad's had too much to drink.</font>

708
00:40:05,320 --> 00:40:05,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's okay.</font>

709
00:40:05,960 --> 00:40:06,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry for the trouble.</font>

710
00:40:06,710 --> 00:40:07,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No rush.</font>

711
00:40:07,840 --> 00:40:08,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll be leaving right away.</font>

712
00:40:08,580 --> 00:40:09,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry about this.</font>

713
00:40:09,250 --> 00:40:09,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Come on. - No, no.</font>

714
00:40:09,960 --> 00:40:11,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No rush. Anyone who comes in</font>

715
00:40:11,020 --> 00:40:12,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- is a guest. - Where's the Moutai?</font>

716
00:40:12,070 --> 00:40:13,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dad, this is a cocktail bar.</font>

717
00:40:13,070 --> 00:40:13,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They don't have Moutai.</font>

718
00:40:13,880 --> 00:40:14,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then do you have</font>

719
00:40:14,800 --> 00:40:16,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">anything around the same price as Moutai?</font>

720
00:40:16,550 --> 00:40:17,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why would a cocktail bar have Moutai?</font>

721
00:40:17,670 --> 00:40:18,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dad, stop embarrassing yourself. Let's go.</font>

722
00:40:19,840 --> 00:40:20,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Between us,</font>

723
00:40:20,360 --> 00:40:21,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who's the dad here?</font>

724
00:40:24,030 --> 00:40:24,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You got anything?</font>

725
00:40:25,360 --> 00:40:25,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Money's no object.</font>

726
00:40:26,360 --> 00:40:26,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Open your most expensive bottle.</font>

727
00:40:30,360 --> 00:40:30,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We do.</font>

728
00:40:31,590 --> 00:40:31,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Open it.</font>

729
00:40:32,150 --> 00:40:32,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've got great taste.</font>

730
00:40:34,360 --> 00:40:36,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But this one has a pretty complex flavor.</font>

731
00:40:37,030 --> 00:40:38,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It needs some time to chill</font>

732
00:40:38,630 --> 00:40:40,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">before its unique flavor really comes through.</font>

733
00:40:41,190 --> 00:40:42,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How about this?</font>

734
00:40:42,510 --> 00:40:44,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll chill it for you tonight.</font>

735
00:40:44,670 --> 00:40:45,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you still want it tomorrow,</font>

736
00:40:46,190 --> 00:40:48,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we'd be delighted to have you back.</font>

737
00:40:49,070 --> 00:40:49,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Open it.</font>

738
00:40:50,030 --> 00:40:51,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What if I die tomorrow?</font>

739
00:40:51,510 --> 00:40:52,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I'd regret missing out.</font>

740
00:40:53,280 --> 00:40:54,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Enjoy today's pleasures today.</font>

741
00:40:55,590 --> 00:40:56,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't wait for tomorrow.</font>

742
00:41:03,590 --> 00:41:03,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here.</font>

743
00:41:10,480 --> 00:41:12,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe we shouldn't open the bottle.</font>

744
00:41:12,360 --> 00:41:13,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll make your dad something nonalcoholic.</font>

745
00:41:14,760 --> 00:41:15,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here, sit down.</font>

746
00:41:15,360 --> 00:41:15,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks. Thanks.</font>

747
00:41:16,670 --> 00:41:17,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm Li Sa.</font>

748
00:41:18,230 --> 00:41:19,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Judging by how much your dad can drink...</font>

749
00:41:19,880 --> 00:41:21,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Forget his tolerance. At least he's a decent drunk.</font>

750
00:41:23,360 --> 00:41:23,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Sa.</font>

751
00:41:24,760 --> 00:41:25,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

752
00:41:27,880 --> 00:41:28,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here.</font>

753
00:41:30,360 --> 00:41:31,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get some vitamin C.</font>

754
00:41:35,280 --> 00:41:35,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well said!</font>

755
00:41:37,710 --> 00:41:38,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here you go.</font>

756
00:41:40,630 --> 00:41:41,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Young man, let me tell you.</font>

757
00:41:42,360 --> 00:41:43,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">-Here. -You and I</font>

758
00:41:43,590 --> 00:41:44,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are in exactly the same line of work.</font>

759
00:41:45,920 --> 00:41:46,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir,</font>

760
00:41:46,590 --> 00:41:47,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you're in this business too?</font>

761
00:41:47,710 --> 00:41:48,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's one little difference.</font>

762
00:41:49,280 --> 00:41:50,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here,</font>

763
00:41:50,880 --> 00:41:52,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there's a bar between you and your customers.</font>

764
00:41:52,960 --> 00:41:53,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where I work,</font>

765
00:41:54,800 --> 00:41:56,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there's a coffin lid between us.</font>

766
00:41:56,800 --> 00:41:58,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But we're both serving people.</font>

767
00:42:00,230 --> 00:42:01,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In service work,</font>

768
00:42:01,800 --> 00:42:03,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">rich or poor,</font>

769
00:42:04,400 --> 00:42:05,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">everyone gets treated the same.</font>

770
00:42:05,880 --> 00:42:06,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Me,</font>

771
00:42:07,000 --> 00:42:08,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've worked funerals most of my life.</font>

772
00:42:08,800 --> 00:42:09,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">First-generation funeral worker.</font>

773
00:42:10,360 --> 00:42:10,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Him?</font>

774
00:42:11,590 --> 00:42:13,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Former second-generation funeral worker.</font>

775
00:42:13,920 --> 00:42:15,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He was supposed to follow in my footsteps.</font>

776
00:42:16,150 --> 00:42:16,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But then</font>

777
00:42:17,230 --> 00:42:18,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">our land back home was requisitioned,</font>

778
00:42:18,630 --> 00:42:19,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and life got better.</font>

779
00:42:21,030 --> 00:42:22,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He was going to be a rich kid.</font>

780
00:42:25,670 --> 00:42:28,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So I brought him to Beijing.</font>

781
00:42:28,150 --> 00:42:29,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See more of the world.</font>

782
00:42:29,550 --> 00:42:30,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Broaden his horizons. - Dad.</font>

783
00:42:30,400 --> 00:42:30,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop talking.</font>

784
00:42:31,030 --> 00:42:31,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Coffin lids?</font>

785
00:42:31,760 --> 00:42:32,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Rich or poor?</font>

786
00:42:32,760 --> 00:42:33,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Read the room.</font>

787
00:42:34,840 --> 00:42:36,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How's he supposed to do business with you talking like that?</font>

788
00:42:38,110 --> 00:42:40,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Life and death, wine and pleasure.</font>

789
00:42:40,760 --> 00:42:42,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've both experienced these two very different lives.</font>

790
00:42:42,360 --> 00:42:42,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now that's</font>

791
00:42:43,360 --> 00:42:43,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a life well lived.</font>

792
00:42:44,360 --> 00:42:44,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nice.</font>

793
00:42:46,550 --> 00:42:47,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well said.</font>

794
00:42:47,550 --> 00:42:48,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Great service, too.</font>

795
00:42:48,800 --> 00:42:49,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell you what.</font>

796
00:42:50,670 --> 00:42:51,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This bar of yours?</font>

797
00:42:52,840 --> 00:42:53,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm investing.</font>

798
00:43:25,420 --> 00:43:28,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I drift along through time♪</font>

799
00:43:28,780 --> 00:43:32,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪And let memory's tenderness♪</font>

800
00:43:32,060 --> 00:43:35,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Carry me to freedom♪</font>

801
00:43:36,740 --> 00:43:39,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In my panic, I hold on tight♪</font>

802
00:43:40,100 --> 00:43:42,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪As if I've gained nothing at all♪</font>

803
00:43:42,540 --> 00:43:45,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I get lonely, I make mistakes♪</font>

804
00:43:47,900 --> 00:43:50,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In an embrace, I feel boundless♪</font>

805
00:43:51,260 --> 00:43:54,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Grateful for those hands♪</font>

806
00:43:54,220 --> 00:43:57,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪That hold me like the sky♪</font>

807
00:43:57,660 --> 00:43:59,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In every♪</font>

808
00:43:59,980 --> 00:44:02,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Moment of missing you♪</font>

809
00:44:02,460 --> 00:44:05,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I linger there awhile♪</font>

810
00:44:09,340 --> 00:44:12,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I look up at the stars♪</font>

811
00:44:13,180 --> 00:44:16,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Who hasn't stumbled bravely on♪</font>

812
00:44:16,660 --> 00:44:19,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Chasing the ever-changing sky?♪</font>

813
00:44:20,500 --> 00:44:23,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this earthly life♪</font>

814
00:44:24,500 --> 00:44:27,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Who hasn't faced the wind despite the pain♪</font>

815
00:44:27,900 --> 00:44:31,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Holding fast to love and what we have?♪</font>

816
00:44:32,300 --> 00:44:35,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I have loved deeply♪</font>

817
00:44:35,780 --> 00:44:39,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Yet I must say goodbye and let go♪</font>

818
00:44:39,260 --> 00:44:42,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪And learn what it means to be moved♪</font>

819
00:44:42,260 --> 00:44:45,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪What it means to love and to dream♪</font>

820
00:44:45,220 --> 00:44:50,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In the universe that bears my name♪</font>

821
00:44:55,580 --> 00:44:59,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I have loved deeply♪</font>

822
00:44:59,060 --> 00:45:02,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Yet I must say goodbye and let go♪</font>

823
00:45:02,540 --> 00:45:05,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪And learn what it means to be moved♪</font>

824
00:45:05,540 --> 00:45:08,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪What it means to love and to dream♪</font>

825
00:45:08,460 --> 00:45:14,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In the universe that bears my name♪</font>
